Domain StudentIdentificationAndDemographics
    documentation
"The Student Identification and Demographics domain represents the core information about students and parents.
* The Student entity captures important information and characteristics of a student.
* The Contact entity spans all variants of contact - parent, guardian, caretaker or other important contact.
* The StudentParentAssociation links students and parents and indicates the relation."
    domain entity Contact
    domain entity ContactIdentity  
    domain entity Student
    domain entity StudentContactInformation
    domain entity StudentDemographics
    domain entity StudentIdentity
    domain entity Person
    association StudentContactAssociation
    association StudentEducationOrganizationAssociation